      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here is a detailed set of test cases designed to provide extensive granular coverage for the CyberShield firewall module.\n\n*   Test connectivity to blacklisting API endpoint for successful addition of a single IP.\n*   Test the system's response when receiving an API update to instantly de-list a previously blocked IP.\n*   Validate traffic filtering accuracy when a TCP packet matches a newly added blacklisted IP in real time.\n*   Verify firewall blocking behavior when a UDP packet from a known blacklisted source is received.\n*   Inject malformed TCP headers (e.g., incorrect flags or sequence numbers) and confirm rejection.\n*   Validate feature protection against common header structure violations in incoming UDP streams.\n*   Simulate a gradual increase in CPU load exceeding the defined threshold to trigger scaling mechanisms.\n*   Confirm that rule adjustment successfully accommodates the increased load without service interruption.\n*   Attempt to modify or delete a critical firewall log file while the module is actively running and monitoring traffic.\n*   Verify log integrity by checking for cryptographic signatures or checksums on captured log entries post-capture.",
