      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, but the score is still pretty low. I need way more granular coverage. The script is flagging this as \"low coverage\" because there aren't enough individual test points.\n\nDon't just group things together. I want you to break everything down into its smallest possible components. For example, instead of \"Test connectivity to API,\" I want \"Verify API handshake,\" \"Verify API authentication,\" \"Verify API response time,\" etc. \n\nPlease maximize the number of bullet points. The more granular the better—I need a huge list so we can ensure nothing is missed. Can you expand this significantly?",
      "source": "evaluator"
